{
  "_comment": [
    "W6 的整定設定。與 config.baseline.json 的差別只有外圈 die0 PID 的兩個係數。",
    "係數不是試出來的，也不是手打的：",
    "  proportionalCoeff = -(tau / (|K|(lambda+theta))) * 150 RPM/%PWM",
    "  integralCoeff     = -(Kc / Ti) * 150 RPM/%PWM",
    "K/tau/theta 來自 bench/data/exp01_fit.txt（Fig 1 的量測），lambda = 2*tau。",
    "那個 150 是 plant 的 PWM->RPM 斜率（rpmMax/100），因為 L1 控制器輸出的是",
    "PWM 百分比、swampd 外圈輸出的是 RPM —— 兩邊量綱差 150 倍。",
    "重算：python bench/tune.py --lambda-mult 2.0",
    "守門員：test/python/test_swampd_config.py 會重算一次並比對這個檔案。",
    "內圈 fan0 的係數刻意留 0，理由見 config/swampd/README.md。"
  ],
  "sensors": [
    {
      "name": "die0",
      "type": "temp",
      "readPath": "/xyz/openbmc_project/sensors/temperature/die0",
      "timeout": 0,
      "ignoreDbusMinMax": true
    },
    {
      "name": "fan0",
      "type": "fan",
      "readPath": "/tmp/sys/fan0_input",
      "writePath": "/tmp/sys/pwm0",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 255,
      "timeout": 0
    }
  ],
  "zones": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "minThermalOutput": 3000.0,
      "failsafePercent": 100.0,
      "pids": [
        {
          "name": "die0",
          "type": "temp",
          "inputs": [
            "die0"
          ],
          "setpoint": 65.0,
          "pid": {
            "samplePeriod": 1.0,
            "proportionalCoeff": -220.27862430865122,
            "integralCoeff": -5.009520247172092,
            "feedFwdOffsetCoeff": 0.0,
            "feedFwdGainCoeff": 0.0,
            "integralLimit_min": 0.0,
            "integralLimit_max": 15000.0,
            "outLim_min": 3000.0,
            "outLim_max": 15000.0,
            "slewNeg": 0.0,
            "slewPos": 0.0
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "fan0",
          "type": "fan",
          "inputs": [
            "fan0"
          ],
          "setpoint": 0.0,
          "pid": {
            "samplePeriod": 0.1,
            "proportionalCoeff": 0.0,
            "integralCoeff": 0.0,
            "feedFwdOffsetCoeff": 0.0,
            "feedFwdGainCoeff": 0.0,
            "integralLimit_min": 0.0,
            "integralLimit_max": 100.0,
            "outLim_min": 30.0,
            "outLim_max": 100.0,
            "slewNeg": 0.0,
            "slewPos": 0.0
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
